<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome!\rJust so you know, all the big exhibits\ngot sent to OTHER museums.\rSo admission is free!\n’cause there’s nothin’ here! Go ’head.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know you can get homies outta\nFossils? Jurassic Park style!\rIf you ever need it, lemme handle it!\nWhat could go wrong?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back anytime you wanna\nget homies outta Fossils.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll get it out for you.\rCome back in a while!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo!\rI got a homie outta\nyour Fossil!\rIt’s called {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}.\nTake good care of it!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oops!\nYour crew look full.\rWhy don’t you hit the PC\nto make room for it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! You ain’t got no Fossils.\rYou find ’em smashin’ rocks at the Ruins\nof Alph and stuff. Bring a hammer.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wanna get a homie outta\nthe {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wanna give the {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}\nyou got a street name? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">They say meteorites hit near Pewter\nCity.\rWe’d LOVE to show ’em here, but...\rThey give off weird energy and can’t be\nmoved. We tried. Two interns quit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s two places I love! The Ruins of\nAlph in Johto...\rAnd the Pewter Museum! So quiet and\ncalm. ’cause there’s nothin’ in it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m grateful for my long life.\rI never thought I’d see the bones of a\ndragon! Before my OWN bones went out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">..................\rAll them shinin’ stars at night is\nstones I’ll never get to know... I’m a\frock nerd.\fIt’s lonely.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Steven: People who dedicate themselves\nto what they believe stand out in a\fcrowd.\rI’m dedicated to ROCKS. My passion just\nas big as yours.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh!\nThat thing you got...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This stone is...so mysterious!\rSomethin’ shinin’ inside it...\nThe stone humble...but hidin’\fsomethin’ wonderful!\rYou shoulda experts\nstudy it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} handed the Enigma Stone\nto the researcher!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ma check it.\nHold on a sec?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for waitin’!\nIt took a minute,\fbut I confirmed it!\rThis a Orb that hold\nwhat they call {COLOR 2}Soul Dew{COLOR 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Soul Dew ain’t no regular thing\nand it’s rare to see.\fI’d love to study it close.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Steven: They say Soul Dew is the\nhardened spirits of LATIAS and LATIOS.\rIt got the power to bring out the\ntrue potential of LATIAS and LATIOS.\rThe spirits of those homies and\nSoul Dew supposedly call out to\feach other...\rOnly thing that puzzle me is\nwhere the Soul Dew got found.\fWhy Kanto?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Stringy and twisty...\nIs this a plant Fossil?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a curved, sharp Fossil.\nThis might be...\fthe Fossil of a meat-eater?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s flat and look hard.\nThis might be...\fa part that protected its body?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hard amber tree sap with\nsomethin’ inside!\rIf you can get it out, you can\nget a homie from\fancient times...?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lil bones put together into\nsome kinda homie!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The rough stone got words carved\ninto it...\r“This a unknown object\nfound at Mt. Moon. Might be a\fmoon rock.”</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thick, well-read books!\r“The Principles of Fossil Extraction”\f“Archaeology Manual”\f“Lost Pokémon”\f“Pokémon Ancestors”\f“Friendships of Hustlers and Pokémon”\f“Caring at the Loamy Layer of Kanto”</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0464_T03R0101_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Our museum mostly show\nFossils and specimens from Kanto.\rEnjoy the extinct homies\nthrough their remains, and\fstep back into the ancient world.</language>
	</row>
</body>
